OL,3,GNEWSASouthport survivor 'violated' by
OL,4,A'morbid curiosity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA yoga teacher who was seriously
OL,7,Finjured in the Southport knife attack
OL,8,Fhas said she feels "violated" by the
OL,9,F"inexcusable morbid curiosity" of NHS
OL,10,Fstaff who allegedly accessed her
OL,11,Fmedical records inappropriately.
OL,13,FLeanne Lucas was helping to run a
OL,14,FTaylor Swift-themed dance class when
OL,15,FBebe King, six, Elsie Dot Stancombe,
OL,16,Fseven, and nine-year-old Alice Da Silva
OL,17,FAguiar were fatally attacked in the
OL,18,FMerseyside town on 29 July 2024.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
