OL,3,GNEWSASouthport survivor 'violated' by
OL,4,A'morbid curiosity'
OL,5,
OL,6,FLucas, who was one of two adults hurt
OL,7,Falong with eight other children, spoke
OL,8,Fout after news emerged that two more
OL,9,FNHS staff were under investigation over
OL,10,Fallegations they inappropriately
OL,11,Faccessed Southport victims' medical
OL,12,Frecords.
OL,14,FThe latest cases were identified by
OL,15,FLiverpool Heart and Chest Hospital in a
OL,16,F"retrospective audit".
